                                                     rdfs:label "Single point caa005b-cl-atom-extfil-test" ;
                                                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "same isolated Cl atom via EXTFIL (external basis file) instead of BASNAM; got further (basis read correctly) but hit the identical DGEMM crash -- ruled out BASNAM specifically as the cause, and ruled out core count (crashed the same at 8 and 1 cores)" .


###  http://example.org/exp_caa005bIRC-def2svp-test
<http://example.org/exp_caa005bIRC-def2svp-test> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
